        "acc_1": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Details",
            "specs": "AC outlets: 5 × 3-prong grounded, on 3 sides\nUSB: 2 × USB-C (20W PD) + 2 × USB-A, shared output\nRating: 125V · 15A · 1,875W total, shared with the wall outlet\nSurge: 1,050 joules, TVS + MOV + GDT, protected-indicator light\nNight light: Dusk-to-dawn sensor, touch control with 3 brightness levels\nHousing: Flame-retardant PC\nCertification: ETL listed · FCC\nSize: Add measurements from your sample",
            "content": "<p><strong>What to plug in:</strong> everything shares one 15A / 1,875W wall circuit. Phones, lamps, TVs, routers and a coffee maker are fine. Space heaters, hair dryers and two heat appliances at once go straight into the wall.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_2": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to install",
            "specs": "",
            "content": "<ol><li>Unscrew the centre screw from your outlet's cover plate. Leave the plate on.</li><li>Plug Plug-Pal into the outlet so it sits flat against the plate.</li><li>Screw it in with the long screw from the box until it's snug. Don't over-tighten.</li></ol><p>No wiring and no power switched off at the breaker. To remove it, reverse the steps and put your old screw back.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_3": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's in the box",
            "specs": "",
            "content": "<ul><li>Plug-Pal outlet extender</li><li>Long 6-32 mounting screw (replaces your cover-plate screw)</li><li>Install card with the load guide on the back</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "acc_4": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will it fit my outlet?",
            "specs": "",
            "content": "<p>It fits a standard US or Canadian two-socket, 3-prong grounded outlet with a centre screw holding the cover plate. If your plate is extra deep, use the long screw in the box.</p><p>It won't fit 2-prong outlets, and it needs a solid outlet. If yours is loose, cracked or pushes into the wall, get that fixed first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_5": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping & Delivery",
            "specs": "",
            "content": "<p>Orders are processed in 1–3 business days and delivered in 6–12. You'll get a tracking link by email as soon as it ships.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_6": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Refunds & Guarantee",
            "specs": "",
            "content": "<p>Try it for 30 days. If it doesn't fit your outlet or you're not happy with it, contact us for a refund. If a night light or USB port arrives faulty, we'll replace it. Full details in our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund policy\">refund policy</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
